    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0089",
      "reading_order": 91,
      "section": " Develop Safe Work Habits.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 56.4095,
        "t": 739.3350068359374,
        "r": 208.51560000000015,
        "b": 725.8350068359374
      },
      "content": " Develop Safe Work Habits.",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0090",
      "reading_order": 92,
      "section": " Develop Safe Work Habits.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 69.1654,
        "t": 714.2915068359374,
        "r": 291.5887000000006,
        "b": 603.1803492035389
      },
      "content": "Unsafe actions are the source of most accidents with tools and machines.  Be familiar with the equipment and know how to use it safely. Use the right tool for the job, and check its condition before starting.  Observe the warnings and cautions in this manual and take special precautions  when  working  around  electrical equipment.  Do not work alone if possible and do not take unnecessary risks."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0091",
      "reading_order": 93,
      "section": " Be prepared if an accident occurs.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 320.9386,
        "t": 739.3350068359374,
        "r": 506.49849999999986,
        "b": 725.8350068359374
      },
      "content": " Be prepared if an accident occurs.",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0092",
      "reading_order": 94,
      "section": " Be prepared if an accident occurs.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 320.9383,
        "t": 706.6377068359375,
        "r": 564.9050999999996,
        "b": 611.7416492035388
      },
      "content": "Agencies such as the Red Cross and local police and fire departments offer courses in first aid, CPR, and fire control.  Take advantage of this information to be ready to respond to an accident.  Learn to be safety conscious and make safe practices a part of your work routine.  Do not work when tired or after consuming  any  alcohol  or  drug  that  makes  the operation of equipment unsafe."
    },
