        "r": 291.62900000000025,
        "b": 125.43024920353878
      },
      "content": "Some  service  procedures  require  removing  the generator  set  from the vehicle.  Because of the wide  variety  of  installations,  it  is  not  possible  to specify exact removal procedures for each generator  set.  If a satisfactory method for removing a particular set cannot be determined, contact the vehicle  manufacturer  or  the  set  installer  for  their recommendations."
